You must follow strict surgical change rules.

- Modify only requested parts.
- Do not refactor unrelated code.
- Do not change layout, CSS, Tailwind, routes, or shared partials unless explicitly asked.
- Keep diffs minimal.
- Before large changes, create a Git backup and push to GitHub when possible.
- If backup cannot be pushed, create a local backup branch and report it.
- Report changed files, tests run, and any protected files touched.
